tegory_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","review_id":"Wy8JDFzO8_KuBPZD0jLcrg","date":"2014-09-16T15:52:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9063934087753296,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. Simple food. Cheap meal and fun diner for breakfast and lunch. The couple that have owned this joint for like 30 yrs are just as sweet as can be. Very accommodating and obliging to whatever you need or want. I love their daily specials. I mean where can one go and eat for $13 after tip, where a server is involved, for a filling satisfying meal of comfort food? No where, but here at Leni's you can! Pete, Deb and Wendy are a wonderful treat for my partner and I in the morning for breakfast, after our ridiculously early boot camp. Without fail they are there to fill us up and help start the day off right. Always fun conversation with our server and will always bend over ba..."},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","review_id":"jGL-pHOCSZnbHPtzyOD8PA","date":"2021-05-20T00:26:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.905144989490509,"text_excerpt":"We recently purchased a condo on Julia Street and discovered this old time gem. I love the old fashioned cash register and the old time diner atmosphere. Staff are very nice and you receive your meal quickly. Everything was hot and tasty. We've had the meatball poboy, cheeseburger, hamburger steak, ham and cheese, and BLT. Will have to try breakfast next. Happy to find this reasonably priced gem!"},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","review_id":"J5DIqxZTHfNBsTru3iGCkg","date":"2020-01-07T19:58:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8932834267616272,"text_excerpt":"Established in late 60's and taken over by current chef-owner in 1978, Lenis still stands in warehouse district with loyal following who had been having breakfast and lunch here for few decades. The oysters po boys are fresh and tasty, and streams of locals young and old crowd this joint in the morning everyday. For a taste of local New Orleans one should not miss what is good food and of good value and been long-standing in the community. For me as a food traveler, Leni serves up local flavours in non-pretentious settings and I get to experience local cuisine the way the real locals eat. Taste wise it's based on fresh ingredients and not spicy sauce. So if you are into burst of heavy fla..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","photo_id":"AMjYuKi-O70RkvfXRX11dg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/AMjYuKi-O70RkvfXRX11dg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9085094928741455},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","photo_id":"YsPk3dYjy12ehYmzRUXgyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YsPk3dYjy12ehYmzRUXgyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8827085494995117},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","photo_id":"AhDaeGDwU14Jx3wFHrouNQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AhDaeGDwU14Jx3wFHrouNQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8756083250045776},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","photo_id":"j4WSMPwn5VESWkUw-aU_fw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j4WSMPwn5VESWkUw-aU_fw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8403135538101196},{"business_id":"6dMQTOH8Efl6m2eJRgIjCw","photo_id":"U9pgvHjQnx2lZG9N-mXknw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U9pgvHjQnx2lZG9N-mXknw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7865874767303467}]},"notebook_case":null}
